//! The version of this program shown under ☰ Settings, Version (the owner, 7 November 2026: "version of
//! this program, place in the setting include change version synposis in one para"). Numbered by the
//! date it went live in Singapore, with the count of releases that day; each release replaces the
//! paragraph with one saying what changed in it.

pub const VERSION: &str = "2026.11.07 (4)";

pub const SYNOPSIS: &str = "This version shows each document's version beside its filing number at the top of the page, for example 2026-1106_#1 · v.13, taken from the file's own name or, failing that, its version on this site. Documents can now be hidden: a hidden document leaves All documents, the menu's list, the globe, search and the landing page for everyone, but is kept, and Show hidden on All documents lists it again with Unhide. Each row of All documents has a ⋯ with Hide and Delete, and Manage (rename, hide, delete) now sits at the top of a document's side panel for whoever added it and for the owner. Settings now lists this Version page. On trip pages, a small # beside every section, day and Gallery day shares a link to that very spot: the link opens the document there, and a Gallery day opens in the Gallery. The Gallery now shows each picture and each post once a day, with one Facebook link per account a day.";
